Package: voidwm
Version: @VERSION@
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libx11-6, libxext6, libcairo2, libpango-1.0-0, libpangocairo-1.0-0, libglib2.0-0, x-terminal-emulator
Recommends: picom, feh
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Maintainer: VoidOS Project <voidos@example.com>
Homepage: https://<your-gh-username>.github.io/<your-apt-repo>
Description: VoidOS floating X11 window manager with bar and dock
 A small, real X11 desktop environment: a floating/reparenting window
 manager with a top status bar, an auto-hiding bottom dock, per-window
 titlebars with traffic-light controls, and virtual workspaces.
 .
 Installs a session entry so it shows up in display managers
 (LightDM/GDM/SDDM) as "VoidOS", alongside GNOME/KDE/etc.
